# Fix Expanded View QR & Enhance Scanner

## Problem Description
1.  **Expanded Profile View**: The user sees a "different old qr" in the full-screen profile view. This is because the code uses the `QrCode` *icon* from `lucide-react-native` instead of the [QRCodeGenerator](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/shared/QRCodeGenerator.tsx#16-80) component.
2.  **Scanner Limitations**: The user wants to scan from the gallery and scan "anywhere" (implying the current UI/UX is too restrictive or they want to scan static images).

## Proposed Changes

### apps/gurudevi-mobile

#### [MODIFY] [ProfileScreen.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/ProfileScreen.tsx)
- Import [QRCodeGenerator](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/shared/QRCodeGenerator.tsx#16-80).
- In the `isFullScreen` modal, replace `<QrCode size={200} ... />` with `<QRCodeGenerator value={profile?.id} size={200} ... />`.

#### [MODIFY] [ScannerModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/shared/ScannerModal.tsx)
- Import `launchImageLibraryAsync` from `expo-image-picker`.
- Import `BarCodeScanner` from `expo-barcode-scanner` (Need to install).
- Add a "Gallery" button to the scanner controls.
- Implement `pickImage` function:
    - Pick image.
    - Call `BarCodeScanner.scanFromURLAsync(uri)` to decode.
    - If successful, call `onScan`.
- Update UI:
    - Make the scan frame larger or visual-only (scanning is already full-screen).
    - Add the gallery button icon (e.g., [Image](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/EditProfileModal.tsx#58-77) or `Gallery` icon).

## Dependencies
- [NEW] `expo-barcode-scanner`: Required for `scanFromURLAsync` utility to decode static images.

## Verification Plan
1.  **Expanded View**: Open Profile -> Expand -> Verify correct QR code (not generic icon).
2.  **Scanner**:
    - Open Scanner.
    - Test scanning a real QR code (camera).
    - Test "Gallery" button -> Pick a QR screenshot -> Verify it decodes.
